# Pairs with RetainedRestorable. The scan keeps a doomed manifest an
# increment outside the pass builds on, but not that manifest's own base, so
# the pass deletes the base of a chain it has just decided to keep.
MODULE: RetainedRestorableBlockedNotTransitive
TARGET: RetainedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the dependent scan does not follow the kept manifest's own base

--- FIND
    IN Grow(Grow(Grow(B0)))
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no transitive closure.
    IN B0
--- END